    "title": "German Real Estate Foreclosure & ZVG-Portal Scraper",
    "description": "Monitors all official German judicial foreclosure auctions from zvg-portal.de across all 16 federal states with market appraisals, court file numbers, land registry details and auction dates.\n\nSynchronous API endpoint returning structured dataset items directly.",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Andre Grunert - Enterprise API Integrations",
      "url": "https://github.com/andregrunert-ctrl/german-b2b-data-suite"
    }
  },
